      "source_line_start": 202,
      "source_line_end": 212,
      "current_tex": "\\begin{definition}[Topological Closure]\\label{def:topological-closure}\nLet \\(X\\) be a topological space, and let \\(E\\subseteq X\\).  The\n\\emph{closure} of \\(E\\) in \\(X\\) is\n\\[\n\\overline{E}^{\\,X}\n=\n\\mathrm{Cl}_{X}(E)\n=\n\\bigcap\\{K\\subseteq X:E\\subseteq K\\text{ and }K\\text{ is closed in }X\\}.\n\\]\n\\end{definition}",
      "formalizations": []
    }
